{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6005002010010","name":"摩美々","text":"──っ…………こほっ\r\n……んん……","trans":"——…………咳\n……嗯嗯……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……摩美々、具合は大丈夫か？","trans":"……摩美美，身体没事吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6005002010020","name":"摩美々","text":"はいー\r\nご心配おかけしましたぁ","trans":"是的——\n让您担心了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"喉の方も治ったか？","trans":"嗓子也好了吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6005002010030","name":"摩美々","text":"ぼちぼちですかねー……\r\n薬も飲みましたんでー……","trans":"差不多吧——……\n药也吃过了——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そうか……まだ本番が控えてるんだ\r\nあまり無理しないようにな","trans":"这样啊……正式演出还在后头\n别太勉强自己","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}